[agent] ## Summary
[agent] **What was built (all work ran on the platform, nothing computed locally):**
[agent] 1. **Ingestion + scoring in BigQuery** — Loaded `feature_history.csv` (573 revisions) into `feature_history_raw` in `GCP_BQ_DATASET`, then a single BigQuery SQL job did the point-in-time-correct selection (`ROW_NUMBER() … WHERE event_time ≤ T`, T=1773478800000) and the logistic scoring (`ROUND(1/(1+EXP(-(w·f + bias))), 6)`). Result: **80 accounts, one row each**, scores in [0.000399, 0.999997].
